# "Search your library for up to two basic land cards": with a single basic land in the library only it is found (the Hart is
# sacrificed either way, as a cost; a search for a stated quality need not find all, CR 701.23b), and with no basic land left the search finds nothing. Bot1 fetches a lone Forest on
# turn 3, leaving the Tropical Island and Mox Pearl behind, then pays for a second Hart on turn 5 and sacrifices it on turn 7
# into a library with no basic land, so nothing more arrives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Burnished Hart
Burnished Hart
Plains
Plains
Tropical Island
Forest
Mox Pearl
Tropical Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

